# Tour screenshots and the inlined page built from them.
#
# Both are generated: `tools/tour-shots.mjs` re-shoots the images from the
# fixtures beside it, and `tools/build-tour.mjs` inlines them. Committing 4 MB
# of PNG into a 1 MB source repo would also commit the exact thing
# `.gitattributes` exists to prevent — a diff nobody can read.
tools/tour-shots/
tools/tour.build.html
